  "summary": "Homework 3 for Session 2 (Clients & Pricing). Back-office time budget: team cost rates by role (PRP, ADM, BKM, TEAM, CFO, CPA, CBO), monthly tasks as times per month × time per event × who, per-row rate overrides, 'tech kills it' flags that move work to savings, an administration allowance, per-client technology costs, and services quoted outside the monthly fee. The client field suggests the IDEAL clients from Homework 1 and pulls that client's in-house cost from Homework 2. Presets reproduce the Step 6: Pricing BOS Time Budget examples exactly ($829.95, $1,559.95, $1,149.13). The pricing window shows margin, client savings, annual profit and fee per hour.",
